    "detailed_description": "<strong>Lost Moment is a short walking simulator where you need to find anomalies.</strong><br><br>You wake up again in the middle of the night in your apartment. There\u2019s still time to get some more sleep, but a glass of water before bed wouldn\u2019t hurt. You head to the kitchen and... A knock at the door.<br><br>The whole game takes place in an apartment.<br>Your task is to search for anomalies.<br>You will wake up every hour and check: Has anything changed in your apartment? Has something appeared? Or someone?<br>If something is wrong, you need to exit through the front door.<br>If everything is fine, go back to sleep.<br><br>For the correct choice, time will move forward.<br>For the wrong one, you will be reset to the beginning.<br><br>The game features many unique anomalies that are noticeable.<br>You don\u2019t need to search for them with a magnifying glass.<br><br>You need to last until 7 AM.<br>At least, that\u2019s what you were promised.<br><br><strong>Good night.</strong><br><br><strong>Play Time</strong><br>30-120 min.<br><br><strong>A message from the developer:</strong><br>I made this game alone.<br>The translation into some languages may be inaccurate. If you notice an error, please report it in my Discord channel.<br><br>In the notes, I\u2019ve placed my thoughts that trouble me.<br><br><strong>Thank you in advance for playing :)</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Lost Moment is a short walking simulator where you need to find anomalies.</strong><br><br>You wake up again in the middle of the night in your apartment. There\u2019s still time to get some more sleep, but a glass of water before bed wouldn\u2019t hurt. You head to the kitchen and... A knock at the door.<br><br>The whole game takes place in an apartment.<br>Your task is to search for anomalies.<br>You will wake up every hour and check: Has anything changed in your apartment? Has something appeared? Or someone?<br>If something is wrong, you need to exit through the front door.<br>If everything is fine, go back to sleep.<br><br>For the correct choice, time will move forward.<br>For the wrong one, you will be reset to the beginning.<br><br>The game features many unique anomalies that are noticeable.<br>You don\u2019t need to search for them with a magnifying glass.<br><br>You need to last until 7 AM.<br>At least, that\u2019s what you were promised.<br><br><strong>Good night.</strong><br><br><strong>Play Time</strong><br>30-120 min.<br><br><strong>A message from the developer:</strong><br>I made this game alone.<br>The translation into some languages may be inaccurate. If you notice an error, please report it in my Discord channel.<br><br>In the notes, I\u2019ve placed my thoughts that trouble me.<br><br><strong>Thank you in advance for playing :)</strong>",
    "short_description": "Look for various anomalies happening in your apartment. If you do everything correctly \u2014 time will move forward. If not \u2014 you will return. Good night.",
